# `last`

In [`std/seq`](index.hmd).

```hql
fn last(self: Window<T>) : T
fn last(self) : Option<T>
```

The element at the last position, or `none` over an empty sequence:
`[3, 1, 2] | last` is `2`. Of a window, the last row of its partition.
<!-- hql reference: end -->
